    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Epasaka",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(Okong’ 12:1-20)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mobe mokorenda Epasaka y’Omonene Nyasae oino, ase omotienyi bw’Abibu, ekiagera ase obotuko obomo bw’omotienyi oyio, nario Omonene Nyasae oino abarusetie Misiri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Morusie eng’ondi, gose embori, gose eng’ombe, korwa ase amaicho aino, mogende aase Omonene arachoore abe obomenyo bw’erieta riaye, erio morue eng’iti eria ebe ekeng’wanso gi’Epasaka ase Omonene Nyasae oino.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Timobaisa koria ekeng’wanso ekio amo n’emegati ebeekire ememera; ase engaki y’amatuko atan’abere moraabe mokoria emegati etabeekiri memera, eyio n’emegati y’emechando, ekiagera ekero mwaruete ase ense ya Misiri nigo mwaayererete gotama. Igo ase amatuko aino onsi more moyo mobe mokoinyora rituko mwaruete ase ense ya Misiri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase engaki y’amatuko atan’abere, ememera tenyorekana ase ense yaino yonsi, na enyama y’ekeng’wanso kiaruetwe ase omogoroba bwe rituko rie ritang’ani tetigarigwa ebeo ase obotuko bwonsi goika rituko ria kabere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Timoruera ekeng’wanso gi’Epasaka ase emechie ende yaino, eyi’Omonene Nyasae oino agochia kobaa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aase Omonene Nyasae oino, arachoore koba obomenyo bw’erieta riaye, agwo nao oka moraruere ekeng’wanso gi’Epasaka. Agwo nao moraabe mogokerua ekero kia mogoroba, ase chinsa chireng’aine chiria mwaruete Misiri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moiyeke chinyama chi’ekeng’wanso ekio, mochiriere aase ari’Omonene Nyasae oino, arachoore. Rituko ria kabere mambia, moirane gochia ase chiema chiaino.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase amatuko atano na rimo, morie emegati etabeekiri memera, na ase rituko ria gatan’akabere, mobe n’omosangererekano bw’engeencho enene bw’okomosasiima Omonene Nyasae oino. Ase rituko erio timokora meremo ende yonsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Amatuko Amanene ye’Rigesa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(Okong’ 34:22; Abal 23:15-22)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mobare chichuma isan’aibere, mochaake korwa engaki eria mogochaaka rigesa ase emegondo yaino.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Morende Amatuko Amanene ye Chichuma ase Omonene Nyasae oino, Morente ebiegwa bi’ogwancha ase Omonene Nyasae oino, mobirue buna koreng’ana abasesenirie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agwo aase Omonene arachoore abe obomenyo bw’erieta riaye, nao morageende na mogooke ase obosio bwaye, inwe n’abana baino, abamura n’abaiseke, n’abasomba baino, abamura n’abaiseke, n’Abalawi bamenyete ase emechie yaino, n’abamenyi, ne’chintakana, n’ababoraka bare ase egati yaino.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moinyore ng’a nainwe nigo mwarenge abasomba aaria Misiri, ase ayio morende na kobwata emeroberio eyio yonsi echiikire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Amatuko amanene y’Ebigutu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(Abal 23:33-43)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ekero mwaoorire chindagera chiaino naende mwamitire amasabibu aino inamobe n’amatuko amanene y’Ebigutu ase engaki y’amatuko atan’abere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mogooke ase amatuko ayio, inwe amo nabana baino, abamura n’abaiseke, na abasomba baino, abamura n’abaiseke, na Abalawi, n’abamenyi, ne’chintakana, n’ababoraka, abwo bamenyete ase emechie yaino.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "’Namorende amatuko amanene a Omonene Nyasae oino, ase engaki y’amatuko atano n’abere; moyareende aase agwo Omonene arachoore, ekiagera Omonene Nyasae oino, nasesenie okwama kw’emegondo yaino amo n’emeremo yaino yonsi. Ase ayio monyaare kogooka mwensi amo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ara gatano kera omwaka abanto baino abasacha babe bagoocha ase obosio bw’Omonene Nyasae oino, aase agwo arachoore; bageende aroro ase Amatuko Amanene y’Emegati etabeekiri memera, na ase Amatuko Amanene ye’Chichuma, na ase amatuko amanene y’Ebigutu. Tibageenda ase obosio bw’Omonene bare n’amaboko amasa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kera omonto arue ebinto koreng’ana buna Omonene Nyasae oino, amosesenirie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Amachiiko ase abagaambi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mochoore abagaambi na abateneneri korwa ase ebisaku biaino, babe bakogaamba agwo ase emechie yaino, eyi’Omonene Nyasae oino, agochia kobaa. Abwo babe bakogaamba ebiina bi’abaanto ase oboronge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Timobaisa koonchorana oboronge, gose gwanchereria abanto, gose timoegwa riaaki, ekiagera riaaki nigo rikoukoria amaiso ’abang’aini, naende nigo rikoonchorana na korina abanyaaboronge oboronge bwabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oboronge nabwo bwoka moraabe mokobwatia, erio nario moraabe moyo, na koira ense eri’Omonene Nyasae oino, agochia kobaa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Timobaisa gosimiseria Asera, enyasae eria enkuungu, omote onde bwensi, komenta ase egesasiimero moraagachere Omonene Nyasae oino.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende timobaisa gotenenia esiiro ende yonsi y’ogosasiimwa, ekiagera Omonene Nyasae oino, nageechete ebinto buna ebio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
